{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13114010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13114010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1311401001:1":{"text":"呀，你们回来了！你们已经玩过所有的项目了吗？","source_cn":"呀，你们回来了！你们已经玩过所有的项目了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E611A4322BCD0FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311401002:1":{"text":"……呃，算是吧！","source_cn":"……呃，算是吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B0F8C7AB8A37FE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311401003:1":{"text":"真快啊！我和你们堆完雪人就去打雪仗，然后又回来堆雪人！我堆了……一个，两个……呃……","source_cn":"真快啊！我和你们堆完雪人就去打雪仗，然后又回来堆雪人！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF6BF04E4E47F7A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311401004:1":{"text":"诶？我后来堆了几个雪人呢？怎么忘了……","source_cn":"诶？我后来堆了几个雪人呢？怎么忘了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34297586D518541F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311401005:1":{"text":"小朋友，你一定玩得很累了，还是先回家吧。","source_cn":"小朋友，你一定玩得很累了，还是先回家吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1E7DBC3ED9F5F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"s